<title>HONG KONG: Deutsche Bank sets call warrants on Guoco.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank sets call warrants on Guoco.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG, London Branch said it intended to issue 48 million American-style call warrants on shares of Guoco Group Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants are exercisable into one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$32.30    PREMIUM	   12.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$ 1.08    GEARING	   3.6X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   07.OCT.97   PAYDATE	   18.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG   MIN EXER LOT    10,000</p>
<p> SPOT PRICE	   HK$38.40</p>
<p> NOTES		  GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6933</p>
</text>
